{"applicability_conditions":"式中的元素含量以质量百分比（mass percentage）表示 [34,35]；用于分析 H70~H90 钢中奥氏体稳定性随化学成分的变化。","identity":{"block_id":"b0054","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\mathrm{M} _ {\\mathrm{s}} (^ {\\circ} \\mathrm{C}) = 5 3 9 - 4 2 3 \\mathrm{C} - 3 0. 4 \\mathrm{Mn} - 1 2. 1 \\mathrm{Cr} - 1 7. 7 \\mathrm{Ni} - 7. 5 \\mathrm{Mo} + 1 0 \\mathrm{Co} - 7. 3 \\mathrm{Si}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2017.10.039"},"latex":"\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{s}} (^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}) = 539 - 423\\mathrm{C} - 30.4\\mathrm{Mn} - 12.1\\mathrm{Cr} - 17.7\\mathrm{Ni} - 7.5\\mathrm{Mo} + 10\\mathrm{Co} - 7.3\\mathrm{Si}","purpose":"根据钢的化学成分（各合金元素含量）计算马氏体相变开始温度 M_s。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"马氏体相变开始温度（martensitic transformation starting temperature）","symbol":"\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{s}}","unit":"°C","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"碳含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{C}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"锰含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Mn}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"铬含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Cr}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"镍含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Ni}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"钼含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Mo}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"钴含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Co}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"硅含量","symbol":"\\mathrm{Si}","unit":"mass percentage","value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"经验公式的常数项","symbol":"539","unit":null,"value":"539"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"碳含量的系数","symbol":"423","unit":null,"value":"423"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"锰含量的系数","symbol":"30.4","unit":null,"value":"30.4"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"铬含量的系数","symbol":"12.1","unit":null,"value":"12.1"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"镍含量的系数","symbol":"17.7","unit":null,"value":"17.7"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"钼含量的系数","symbol":"7.5","unit":null,"value":"7.5"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"钴含量的系数","symbol":"10","unit":null,"value":"10"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"硅含量的系数","symbol":"7.3","unit":null,"value":"7.3"}],"unmapped":["根据式(2)计算得到不同固溶条件下的 M_s：H90 为 120 °C，H80 为 67 °C，H70 为 33 °C。","C 含量由 XRD 分析测得，Mn 和 Al 含量由 EDS 分析测得。","C 含量对奥氏体稳定性起重要作用，较低的 C 含量使奥氏体处于亚稳态从而诱发马氏体相变。"]}